From: UN1CA <noreply@unica.local>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Force Audio Eraser global parameter apply

SystemUI sends VOICE_BOOST_EFFECT values to the S26U One UI 8.5
SoundAlive_B2 SAContentProvider. On the ported audio stack, the current-route
branch can store the mode without forcing the global
g_voice_booster_preset_all update needed by the VoiceBooster effect.

Always take SoundAlive_B2's all-path voice-boost branch so third-party
playback selected from the Audio Eraser panel reaches the CoreFx
VoiceBooster command bridge immediately.
---
 .../sec/android/app/soundalive/compatibility/SAContentProvider.smali | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/smali/com/sec/android/app/soundalive/compatibility/SAContentProvider.smali b/smali/com/sec/android/app/soundalive/compatibility/SAContentProvider.smali
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/smali/com/sec/android/app/soundalive/compatibility/SAContentProvider.smali
+++ b/smali/com/sec/android/app/soundalive/compatibility/SAContentProvider.smali
@@ -2322,8 +2322,6 @@
 
     move-result v0
 
-    if-eqz v0, :cond_37
-
     const/4 v0, 0x0
 
     :goto_2a
